  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cronos",
    "summary": "During [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as this unit is **selected to shoot** or **selected to fight**, you can Empower it by paying a [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). While it remains Empowered, whenever it shoots or fights, once its attacks are resolved, if they **destroyed** any enemy models, one of its models regains as many as 3 lost wounds. If instead every model in this unit has its starting wounds and the unit is under its **Starting Strength**, a model returns to it with 3 wounds left.",
